    test_feature_gpu_ptx_gen_spec_stale_duplicate_2026_11_26, 0, "test/feature/usage/gpu_ptx_gen_spec.spl is an older copy of test/03_system/feature/usage/gpu_ptx_gen_spec.spl. It still carries the 12 wrong expectations fixed in the 03_system copy by cuda_gpu_gated_spec_defects_2026-08-09 items 1 and 2 (atom .s64 forms ptxas rejects, missing LaunchConfig import, old emit_call signature, PTX ISA 7.8): 69/81 on the GB10 while the 03_system copy is 81/81. Either delete the duplicate or resync it; not changed in the CUDA lane because the test/feature tree's status is not this lane's call."

